1. Wilaya boundary polygons

   data/geojson/wilaya-boundaries.geojson, 69 features, derived from
   OpenStreetMap `admin_level=4` relations, retrieved 2026-06-21, simplified with
   mapshaper. Provenance, including the one deliberate departure from upstream
   OpenStreetMap, is in data/geojson/wilaya-boundaries.metadata.json.

2. Commune centre coordinates

   323 of the 1,541 commune `latitude` / `longitude` values, each taken from that
   commune's own OpenStreetMap `admin_level=8` relation:

   - 56 corrected on 2026-09-27 from the relation's `admin_centre` node, Overpass
     `timestamp_osm_base` 2026-09-27T11:03:52Z. Every row, with its OSM relation
     id, `admin_centre` node id and `ref:ONS`, is listed in
     research/_commune-centres/corrections-2026-09-27.json in the repository, and
     summarised in data/geojson/communes.metadata.json.
   - 189 corrected on 2026-09-29 from the same node, Overpass
     `timestamp_osm_base` 2026-09-29T12:54:47Z, after every one of the 1,541
     centres was compared with its relation's `admin_centre` and tested against
     the relation's own unsimplified boundary. Every row, with the same ids and
     the four containment verdicts that decided it, is listed in
     research/_commune-centres/corrections-2026-09-29.json.
   - 5 corrected on 2026-10-01 from the same node, same Overpass
     `timestamp_osm_base` 2026-09-29T12:54:47Z, each node re-read from the
     OpenStreetMap node API on 2026-10-01: the wilaya capital communes Biskra
     (701), El Kantara (717), Constantine (2501), El Bayadh (3201) and
     Beni-Abbes (5201), each 3 to 6 km from the seat of the town it is the
     chef-lieu of. Every row, with the same ids and the independent claims that
     decided it, is listed in
     research/_commune-centres/corrections-2026-10-01.json. One of the five,
     Beni-Abbes, additionally carries a reading the project owner took from a
     proprietary map; it is recorded there as a confirmation of this node, which
     it agrees with to 268 m, and never as the published value, so the ODbL
     covers this coordinate exactly as it covers the other four.
   - 68 corrected on 2026-10-01 from the same node, same Overpass
     `timestamp_osm_base` 2026-09-29T12:54:47Z, by the coordinate review engine:
     each of the 136 centres more than 3 km from its seat, or with no seat, was
     weighed against the open sources that state where its town is, and a value
     was written only where at least three of them agree, or two including the
     median of the exact records inside the commune's own outline, with nothing
     voting for a different answer and the value inside that outline. Every row,
     with its Candidates and the Votes that decided it, is listed in
     research/_commune-centres/corrections-2026-10-01b.json; the 67 the engine
     did not settle are in research/_commune-centres/review-queue-2026-10-01.json
