     docs/adr/0001-coordinate-review-by-independent-votes.md. No reading from a
     proprietary map decided any of the 68.
   - 5 corrected in version 2.1.0 from the relation centroid, matched on the
     relation's `ref` tag: Belarbi (2242), El Hamdania (2616), Ouled Bouachra
     (2627), Deux Bassins (2653) and Makhda (2915). See CHANGELOG.md, 2.1.0.
     El Euch (3427) was a sixth until 2026-10-01, when the coordinate review moved
     it 9.7 km off that centroid onto its own `admin_centre` node, so it is counted
